        "text": "The target is Hawaii's state row for reporting period 202608 in dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c, original submission O, resolved on its first official publication. CMS's snapshot table defines the ex parte rate as a percentage of all beneficiaries due for renewal: 100 times Metric 5a1 / Metric 5. This is a raw state-cohort rate, not a national total or weighted interstate average."
